{"id":"pe_rdida","lemma":"pérdida","pos":"noun","rank":1296,"glosses":["loss","leak"],"ipa":"/ˈpeɾdida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pérdidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-p%C3%A9rdida.wav","examples":[{"text":"Siento mucho su pérdida.","en":"Sorry for your loss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448596"},{"text":"La compañía sufrió grandes pérdidas.","en":"The company suffered big losses."},{"text":"Eso es una pérdida de tiempo.","en":"It's a waste of time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453060"},{"text":"Es una gran pérdida de tiempo.","en":"It's a big waste of time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506515"},{"text":"Su muerte es una gran pérdida.","en":"His death is a great loss.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639530"}]}